Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:02.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}In Jujutsu Kaisen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Gojo's {\c&H66E4FF&}infinity{\c&HFFFFFF&} isn't a shield;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}it's a {\c&H66E4FF&}coffin,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}and he's sealed inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:09.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}Infinity{\c&HFFFFFF&} stops anything from touching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}him, but if nothing gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:13.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}in, nothing gets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}Infinity{\c&HFFFFFF&} isn't a wall;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}it's a {\c&H66E4FF&}thermos.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}NASA{\c&HFFFFFF&} spent millions solving this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}exact problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}And astronauts' suit is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}perfect shield, and it still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}needs a {\c&H66E4FF&}radiator.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}You generate about {\c&H66E4FF&}100{\c&HFFFFFF&} watts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}of heat doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}A high-speed fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}roughly a {\c&H66E4FF&}thousand.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Sweating can't save Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}The sweat can't {\c&H66E4FF&}evaporate.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:36.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Roughly four minutes per degree,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:37.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}twenty minutes, and his {\c&H66E4FF&}brain{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}starts {\c&H66E4FF&}cooking.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}He bakes inside his own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:42.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}That's why the {\c&H66E4FF&}six{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H66E4FF&}eyes{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:43.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}are mandatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}He isn't just blocking things;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}he manually filters every single
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}atom:{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}oxygen{\c&HFFFFFF&} in, heat out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:51.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}knives out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}If he loses focus for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:54.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}one second, he cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}He runs {\c&H66E4FF&}reverse{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H66E4FF&}curse{\c&HFFFFFF&} technique
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:58.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}24/7{\c&HFFFFFF&} just to heal the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}brain{\c&HFFFFFF&} damage of doing thermal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}calculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:03.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}{\c&H66E4FF&}NASA{\c&HFFFFFF&} built a {\c&H66E4FF&}radiator.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:04.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Gojo built a {\c&H66E4FF&}brain{\c&HFFFFFF&} that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}never switches off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:07.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}That's the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:07.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}One can be switched off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:08.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}for maintenance;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}the other can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}You've got your own {\c&H66E4FF&}infinity,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:13.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}a rule you never break,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:14.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}so nothing hurts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}The call you don't make,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:18.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}the thing you never try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:19.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}Nothing gets in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}nothing gets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:21.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(110,110)}So {\c&H66E4FF&}what's{\c&HFFFFFF&} yours?
